          unsustainable levels, and is that share still rising? Unweighted stock
          count hit{" "}
          <span className="font-semibold text-rose-300">
            {fmtPct(HEADLINE.unsustainableSharePct)}
          </span>{" "}
          in 2021 ??? up {fmtPp(HEADLINE.deltaPp2019to2021)} from 2019 ??? while
          landings-weighted unsustainable share sits near{" "}
          <span className="font-semibold text-cyan-300">
            {fmtPct(HEADLINE.landingsWeightedUnsustainablePct)}
          </span>
